"Properties are used to represent properties in messages that support it.\nIt is a free-form object, so the application can set any value it sees fit,\nbut a few helper methods are defined to make it easier to instantiate properties\nwith common fields.\nHere's a quick example of how this type is meant to be used:\n\n\tanalytics.page{\n\t\tUserId: \"0123456789\",\n\t\tProperties: analytics.NewProperties()\n\t\t\t.SetRevenue(10.0)\n\t\t\t.SetCurrency(\"USD\"),\n\t}"
